# @name: sed-awk | Filter by Numeric Comparison
# @description: Prints lines where field meets numeric condition Group: Awk Pattern Matching. Template: replace placeholders before running. {field_number} = Field number to check [default "1"] | {operator} = Comparison operator (>, <, >=, <=, ==) [default ">"] | {value} = Value to compare [default "0"] | {file} = Path to the file
awk '${field_number} {operator} {value}' {file}